{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん、こんにちは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "暖かくなったと思ったらちょっと肌寒くなったり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "元気でしょうか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お互い体調を気にかけながら、一緒に歩きたいなぁと思ってます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobGYZ85Z.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobYm5rKV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日のオンラインミート&グリートありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんがかけてくださる言葉ひとつひとつが胸に沁みて、安心することができます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まるで絡まっていた糸がほどけるような\nぐしゃぐしゃだったものが一気に形が見えるというか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私にとって皆さんの言葉は魔法です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうすぐリアルミート&グリートもあって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今月はたくさん皆さんと会えるから嬉しい〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も負けないくらい愛伝えないと！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもよろしくお願いします☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobfb1agJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"t